#: ../../source/docs/common-install-gcs.rst:5
#: 4d0cfeeff22b4273b5b640f29e96a4e8
msgid "Installing Ground Station (GCS) software"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-gcs.rst:7
#: 929a3034a7f34eb088cc7fee9acb6fee
msgid "ArduPilot can be used with :ref:`many different ground stations <common-choosing-a-ground-station>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-gcs.rst:9
#: e3fdd2075ccd4985af80a826bd0918b2
msgid "Developers typically use a *desktop* GCS, as these tend to provide deeper access to vehicle setup parameters and advanced debugging features. If you just want to fly you may instead choose to use a GCS running on a mobile OS (iOS, Android)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-gcs.rst:12
#: 5eb16d409c2c491f8da6e59535527c33
msgid "Installation links for some of the more popular GCS systems are provided below:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-gcs.rst:14
#: 205cf36f3f344e86a49e2c984fbca42d
msgid ":ref:`Mission Planner <planner:home>` (Windows, Linux, Android): :ref:`Install Mission Planner <planner:install-mission-planner>` This GCS is the most compatible and closely tracks new features and updates in ArduPilot. It is recommended for first-time users and power users alike.  It functions best in the Windows environment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-gcs.rst:16
#: b9befb0871124222904c5de9001a3604
msgid "`QGroundControl <http://qgroundcontrol.com/>`__ (Windows, Mac OS X, Linux, Android and iOS).This is the most popular GCS for Android based systems and provides the best presentation on small format devices like cellphones. Does not have all the capabilities of Mission Planner, but has a more user-friendly interface for some functions. Operates well on all platforms"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-gcs.rst:18
#: 8f805d63112d4f4e815c5f839d7881ba
msgid "`Download and Install <https://docs.qgroundcontrol.com/en/getting_started/download_and_install.html>`__ (stable)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-gcs.rst:19
#: 675eae98066a40dbb8df95398fcfa7ff
msgid "`Daily builds <https://docs.qgroundcontrol.com/en/releases/daily_builds.html>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-gcs.rst:21
#: 73d2c8d3c28742acb6027c55ce7d7fb6
msgid ":ref:`APM Planner 2 <planner2:home>` (Windows, Mac OS X, Linux): :ref:`Install APM Planner 2 <planner2:installing-apm-planner-2>` -Provides basic functionality, but is not currently well maintained and updated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-gcs.rst:23
#: 8a0b27b2bc6149488849b5562563bbdf
msgid "`ArduDeck <https://ardudeck.com>`__ (Windows, Mac OS X, Linux): **Currently in Alpha Testing -feedback welcomed!** A free, open-source ground control station built with a modern UI. Supports real-time telemetry, mission planning with terrain-aware altitude profiles, full parameter management, calibration wizards, firmware flashing, visual Lua script editor, and MAVLink signing. Also supports Betaflight and iNav via MSP protocol."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-gcs.rst:25
#: 57f5bca1cd7d4c32944445615470cd01
msgid "`Download and Install <https://ardudeck.com/docs/Getting-Started>`__"
msgstr ""

